  "description": "The Train Plus Mini series is here, bringing the fun of the Train Plus series in a more accessible and easy-to-enjoy format.\n\nIn this title, you can explore the above-ground section of the Jukyo Metro Big Edo Line, famous for its striking orange line color, and experience the joy of train driving at your own pace.\n\nChoose between two ways to enjoy the game:\nIn Free Drive Mode, you can operate the train freely and soak in the fun of driving.\nIn Auto Drive Mode, simply sit back, relax, and enjoy the passing scenery from the train window.\n\nDrive the 10-100 Series, and keep an eye out for the brand-new 10-200 Series, which appears as a passing train and adds even more life to the railway world.\n\nThis title also introduces the series’ first-ever Hyper Real Texture Building feature, making the buildings and cityscape look more detailed, immersive, and visually impressive than ever before.\n\nAnd if you want to dive deeper into the world of the line, the included Setting Materials Collection lets you discover the history and background of the Big Edo Line.\n\nDrive, watch, and explore.\nA compact train game packed with charm for railway fans and casual players alike!",
